 "name_en": "Financial Planning and Analysis (2FM)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Financial Planning and Analysis (2FM)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio58c3af3007434f87bc88e0fa03b06dd6\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio58c3af3007434f87bc88e0fa03b06dd6__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item allows <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> customers to leverage a predefined Financial Statement Version (FSV) that supports financial planning and analysis across the enterprise.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The FSV supports financial planning and analysis within SAP Analytics Cloud and can be used within embedded analytics in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio58c3af3007434f87bc88e0fa03b06dd6__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Structure G/L Account hierarchy for financial planning and analysis for both Profit &amp; Loss and Balance Sheet statements</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio58c3af3007434f87bc88e0fa03b06dd6__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Use prebuilt Financial Statement Version (FSV) to support financial planning and analysis</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Editable by customer in <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> using standard functionality</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Establish SAP S/4HANA as best practice location to maintain financial planning and analysis structures</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>财务计划和分析 (2FM)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio58c3af3007434f87bc88e0fa03b06dd6\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio58c3af3007434f87bc88e0fa03b06dd6__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目允许 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 客户利用预定义的财务报表版本 (FSV)，该版本支持整个企业的财务计划和分析。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">FSV 支持 SAP Analytics Cloud 中的财务计划和分析，可用于 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中的嵌入式分析。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio58c3af3007434f87bc88e0fa03b06dd6__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">为损益表和资产负债表构建财务计划和分析的总账科目层次结构。</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio58c3af3007434f87bc88e0fa03b06dd6__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用预构建的财务报表版本 (FSV) 支持财务计划和分析</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">客户可使用标准功能在 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 中编辑</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">建立 SAP S/4HANA 作为最佳实践位置，以维护财务计划和分析结构</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
